ical assessment and treatment workflows\n- Interact with medical instruments and guided procedures\n- Watch integrated simulation videos for step-by-step learning\n- Train in a safe and repeatable educational environment\n- Improve procedural understanding through immersive visualization\n\nBuilt for Meta Quest, this experience focuses on accessible, hands-on medical education using virtual reality technology. The simulation is designed to support skill development, spatial understanding, and procedural familiarity in an interactive format inspired by modern clinical training platforms.", "short_description": "Immersive VR simulation for learning and practicing equinovarus foot treatment techniques through interactive scenarios and real procedural videos."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/22d04043-16d9-4e7f-81fc-5ebc7a75235b", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aurora pixel studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pocusvr.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_CO"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27144165498512156"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2283827315778769"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2283827315778769"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781120640, "status": "PUBLIS